<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Coaching & Rendimiento Deportivo</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0d1b2a;
      --card-bg: #1b263b;
      --ink: #e0e1dd;
      --muted: #778da9;
      --gold: #e0a96d;
      --gold-dim: rgba(224, 169, 109, 0.15);
      --green: #25D366;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .container { max-width: 540px; width: 100%; }
    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 36px 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .tag {
      background: var(--gold-dim);
      color: var(--gold);
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin: 18px 0 12px;
      color: #fff;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }
    p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .btn-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
    }
    .btn-ws { 
      background: var(--green); 
      color: #fff; 
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.3);
    }
    .btn-demo { 
      background: transparent; 
      border: 1px solid var(--gold); 
      color: var(--gold); 
    }
    .btn:hover { 
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      opacity: 0.95; 
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <section class="card">
      <span class="tag">High Performance & Athletic Coaching</span>
      <h1>Entrenamiento de rendimiento sin improvisación</h1>
      <p>
        Planificación individualizada, control de carga y seguimiento diario. Contacta directamente para valorar tu caso o prueba la plataforma interactiva.
      </p>

      <div class="btn-group">
        <a href="https://wa.me/34637601621?text=Hola!%20Me%20interesa%20recibir%20información%20sobre%20tus%20servicios%20de%20entrenamiento" 
           target="_blank" 
           class="btn btn-ws">
          💬 Contactar por WhatsApp
        </a>

        <button class="btn btn-demo" onclick="alert('Acceso a la plataforma interactiva')">
          ⚡ Probar plataforma (Demo)
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
